 "lessons": [
  {
   "text": "The header stage shows no visible Next/Save button at landing; five icon buttons have no text (learn after choosing an outlet).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json (curated observations)",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "Document Date is read-only and fixed to today, so orders cannot be dated before/after a policy period from this screen (matters for TC46-48).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json (curated observations)",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "On cnr2dev3 as KPO_ph the dropdown data does not appear; on cnr1dev1 as KPO_mp it does.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json (curated observations)",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "cnr2dev3/KPO_slv: distributors offered 50000451-SATHENSOPIN, 50000598-SUPAMITR LV, 50000599-SUPAMITR LV. With 50000451 the PJP dropdown is populated (e.g. PJP14, RiazOB, 200311, 99999, RizwanOB, 110002), so Order Booking works there; with KPO_ph's distributors it does not.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json (curated observations)",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "cnr2dev3/KPO_slv/50000451 (2026-09-25 run 165111): PJP14-PJP14 -> Selling Category HPC -> Section14 -> Outlet 'C0000012520-ป้าA1' works; then the 'Order Detail' button (id orderDetail) appears. Document Date shows 25-09-2026 (dd-MM-yyyy) and is read-only.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json (curated observations)",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "landing state only (header stage); later stages not yet learned",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "cnr2dev3 as KPO_slv, distributor 50000451, 2026-09-25: same fields; dsrType offers only Order Booker and Spot Seller; document date shown as dd-MM-yyyy",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/screens/ORDER_BOOKING.json",
   "date": "2026-09-25"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hand-coded Angular screen (not dyl layout); no top-level Save/Update buttons are rendered until detail rows exist; ids are camelCase not DDL__/TXT__.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "apps/snd/knowledge/screens_observed/LIVE_ORDER_BOOKING.json",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "Element ids change after Order Detail is clicked: PJPNO -> PJP, SELLCAT -> sellingCategory, SECTION -> Section, commentInput -> Comments, refNumberInput -> referenceNumber.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261008-OB/20261008-1120/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-08"
  },
  {
   "text": "Outlet Name: type the outlet code, then pick the single filtered option at once. Typed text is discarded on blur if no option was picked, and a plain click in the long list can select the wrong row.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": "Outlet Name",
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261008-OB/20261008-1120/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-08"
  },
  {
   "text": "Order lines grid number cells (Order CS #quantity1_0, Order PC #quantity3_0): real click, select the cell content, type the digits, Tab (Tab goes CS -> PC; DZ is skipped and not editable). Clear-and-type goes stale because the row re-renders.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261008-OB/20261008-1120/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-08"
  },
  {
   "text": "After Order Detail an empty edit row opens at the top; after each row Save the next edit row opens with the same ids (rowindex 1, #product, #quantity1_0, #rowEditBtn_Save_0) and saved rows move below with rowEditBtn_Edit_N / rowEditBtn_Delete_N.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261009-1305/20261009-1305/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-09"
  },
  {
   "text": "Product (#product) is a type-ahead: type with real key events, wait for the list, then real-click the .dx-list-item. A product without stock answers 'Stock not available.' and clears the row.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261007-OB/20261007-1749/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-07"
  },
  {
   "text": "The final Save (saveBtn) appears only after Validation (validateBtn); saving shows 'Validation successfully' and then 'Order Save successfully'.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261008-OB/20261008-1120/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-08"
  },
  {
   "text": "Order Detail is a button (#orderDetail) that appears only after an Outlet is chosen; it is not a tab. New Order (#newOrder) asks 'Are You sure you want to cancel the order' (Yes = #continue resets the header, No = #reject).",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "knowledge/business/LIVE_FINDINGS.md (L14)",
   "date": "2026-10-01"
  },
  {
   "text": "Order Number is the input #documentNo; the summary amounts (Gross Amount, Discount, Tax, Net Amount) are plain text lines without ids.",
   "kind": "screen",
   "field": null,
   "source": "runs/QUICK-20261007-OB/20261007-1749/friction.md",
   "date": "2026-10-07"
  }
 ],
